+# T-2376 whole left-group source candidate — 2026-11-10
+
+`not_a_reading`: rereading the existing already credited pictures for the original
+parcel sign-off; no newly read archival unit or measured historical dimension.
+
+The actual current native Andreas pair, actual Trowbridge composition and its
+verified Gale n55 plate, Kurz panel 11 and the site file named 1859 were viewed.
+The site 1859 file is an engraving with later commercial shop fronts, awnings,
+lettering and gas lamp. Its filename is not authentication as CHM ICHi-040230.
+The CHM catalogue lead remains unverified/check_required, text-only, excluded
+from geometry and asset derivation. No held reproduction supplies the correction.
+
+Andreas and Kurz show a low foreground gable and a separate higher gable behind
+it. The old constant-height turned range omitted that second silhouette. The
+new optional raised rear section supplies it within the range envelope. Existing
+range depth and front set-out increase together by 0.7 m, retaining its rear
+corner and 25-degree turn. The low connector now falls toward the foreground
+range rather than toward the shoulder. Stock clapboard relief continues across
+the upper shed infill rather than stopping at the low proxy wall height.
+
+These are RECONSTRUCTED form controls: rear section depth 1.6 m, wall 4.5 m,
+roof 37 degrees; low forward section wall 2.6 m and roof 37 degrees; connector
+upper/lower 3.0/2.25 m. No exact metric or stage date is inferred from either
+retrospective image. The two pictures may be dependent. Trowbridge's open bay,
+three upper front sash and attic light, and Gray's later side entrance/bilateral
+addition testimony remain explicit conflicting readings. Under T-3153 those
+picture-to-picture disagreements are within tolerance, not perpetual blockers.
+Main-block geometry, original footprint, geographic placement and source grades
+are unchanged. The occupied range and its entrance move together through the
+existing shared frames; no renderer reconstructs the building independently.
+
+The producer additions default off. An absent rear_gable retains the earlier
+single roof; absent/false falls_away_from_main and shed_infill_clapboard retain
+the earlier slope and infill mesh exactly. Only Green Tree selects these options.
+The full-frame family will be baked once by the parent with the grouped native.
+
+CPU validation: 26 picture-feature tests, front-wall reader contract and Green
+Tree yard modes pass. The regression exercises actual accumulator triangles,
+three roof peaks, connector slope, bounded invalid controls, exact default-off
+geometry and the entrance's new shared physical frame. This is not a native or
+image verdict. Genuine final native bindings, Andreas/Trowbridge/Kurz picture
+renders and published desktop/phone app review remain owed before matches.
