+# Before the Gale core-form choice, 2026-11-10
+
+These are the actual 2.44 m palisade comparisons immediately before the T-2380 core completion candidate. Both source pictures, source bindings, old diagnostic cameras and match records are retained exactly. Neither is a final candidate comparison. The new candidate retains source pixels and site/footprint facts, and reframes the Gale model from northeast to expose the depicted east gables. All camera numbers remain authored diagnostics; they are not historical optical or geographic control.
